{"type":"gap","id":"gap-BM-UI-NEW-BOARD","category":"SPEC_NOT_IMPLEMENTED","priority":"P3","area":"new_board_creation","spec_ref":"BM-UI-LAYOUT","spec_file":"14-board-manager.smd","spec_says":"Board creation must be available from the web UI, not only via MCP. Includes a popup to create a board (name, visibility).","impl_has":"Fully implemented. The board switcher has a '+' icon (add, 20px, accent color) that triggers toggleNewBoard(). A full-screen overlay popup (id='new-board-popup') contains a form with name input and visibility select (private/haven/world). Form POSTs to /create-board. On success, board_id is set to the new board's ID and redirects to /?board={new_id}.","impl_file":"board_manager.py:1480-1484, 1762-1819","recommendation":"Fully compliant. Close.","status":"closed","delta":"NEW"}

